        <div class="case-hero__panel case-hero__text-panel">
          <div class="case-hero__grid">
            <h1 id="mos-title" class="type-display-2xl case-hero__title">
              <span>MOS.</span>
              <span class="case-hero__title-muted">A modern take on “Garalde”, renaissance roman type</span>
            </h1>
          </div>

          <div class="case-hero__grid">
            <div class="type-heading-lg case-hero__summary">
              <p>Inspired by work of Francesco Griffo and Claude Garamond. It has humanistic proportions, weighed forms and calm representation. Due to the reduced contrast and sufficient x-height suitable for a paragraph text, but a number of sharp decisions the typeface opens up his character in display sizes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

