          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="MOS project context">
            <div class="type-body-lg case-prose">
              <p>Graduated from Bolditalic course.</p>
              <p>Mos has only one master (regular, 300), Latin (52 glyphs) and Cyrillic (68 glyphs) set, numbers, and some other basic non-alphabet signs. I spent about 200 hours on it. The font has raw sidebearings and no kerning.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

